		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">EL5152 EtherCAT Terminal</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">EtherCAT Terminal, encoder input terminal. Generic layout: contacts 1 to 8; the signal on each contact depends on the exact type, see its datasheet. The I/O table lists the 8 contacts: edit it in the element properties.</elementInformation>
